# MERGE-SPLIT-SESSION: Merge and Split are tool sessions as UE UCombineMeshesTool / USplitMeshesTool - the merged mesh previews on the first selected (the others hidden), Cancel leaves the inputs, Accept writes one entity; Split previews its part count and Accept makes the parts entities; each Accept is one undo step
# A 100 cm Box at the origin and a radius-50 Sphere apart from it at X 150 (two connected components once merged).
# Frames are the 3D viewport only: a whole-window capture is refused on dev since PRESENT-COST-2 ("no acquired swapchain
# image"), so the tool bar and the status bar are not in them. What they showed is proven by the editor's own answers:
# "Active tool: Accept/Cancel" runs only while a tool is open (else "no modeling tool is active"); "Entity <name>" exists
# only while an entity of that name does; `state selection` (line_NNN_state.txt) names the selected entities.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 75,260,420
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.5,-0.87
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Width 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Depth 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Height 100
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.Radius 50
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 150,50,0
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Split by polygroups: off"
Дано --expect-refusal run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Тогда-вид 0_inputs the Box at the origin and the Sphere beside it on +X, both selected
Дано state selection
Когда run Modeling "XForm: Merge"
Тогда-вид 1_merge_preview the Box and the Sphere drawn as one mesh on the Box (the merged preview; the Sphere entity hidden under it) - the same two shapes, one selection outline around both
Когда state selection
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Тогда-вид 2_merge_cancel the Box and the Sphere as before, unchanged
Когда --expect-refusal run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Когда run Entity Box
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Когда run Modeling "XForm: Merge"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 3_merge_accept the Box and the Sphere shapes as one entity (Box) selected - one outline around both shapes
Когда state selection
Когда --expect-refusal run Entity Sphere
Когда --expect-refusal run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда run Modeling "XForm: Split"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 4_split_accept the same two shapes as two entities (Box and Box Part 1), both selected
Когда state selection
Когда --expect-refusal run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда-вид 5_undo the Box and the Sphere as at the start
Когда --expect-refusal run Entity "Box Part 1"
Когда run Entity Sphere
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Box"
Когда state selection
